    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Overview\u200b</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Dark Eyes: The Narcotic Operation\u201d, linked to the hit TV series &quot;\u626b\u6bd2\u98ce\u66b4&quot;, is an immersive narrative game. In 1988's Wanbei, thick with humid heat and latent danger, you embody Lin Qiangfeng, alias &quot;A Gu&quot;, infiltrating drug lord\u2014\u2014Boss Tiger to bring him to justice, Tiger may seem like the one in charge here, but in reality, there are other forces watching covetously, waiting for an opportunity to take his place, which making your mission far more perilous. This game is not just a story; it's a tribute to the countless anti-narcotics police officers who stand as walls with their bodies, guarding the peace of the country and its people.\u200b</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3785560/extras/9c18072a92e9d0ef94a6372e6ab59951.poster.avif?t=1755742101\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3785560/extras/9c18072a92e9d0ef94a6372e6ab59951.webm?t=1755742101\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3785560/extras/9c18072a92e9d0ef94a6372e6ab59951.mp4?t=1755742101\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Plot Experience\u200b</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Undercover life is a knife-edge dance. In a floral shirt, Hanging around the seedy, mixed-up streets, every breath is cautious. You'll meet a tough ally who might betray you, or a stranger whose glance saves you. Starting as a lowly gofer\u2014serving tea, watching streets\u2014you learn to read faces, navigate tangled interests. Climbing to the gang's top, entering Boss Tiger\u2019s gloomy, antique-filled office, you face his scrutiny and the watchful eyes of his shadowy backers. Success nears, but its cost could be staggering, just as the real anti-narcotics heroes risk everything to uphold justice.\u200b</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3785560/extras/337bb29cfecdf9c00abe6a2ef0efd231.poster.avif?t=1755742101\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3785560/extras/337bb29cfecdf9c00abe6a2ef0efd231.webm?t=1755742101\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3785560/extras/337bb29cfecdf9c00abe6a2ef0efd231.mp4?t=1755742101\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Rich Choices &amp; Plots\u200b</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over 100 choices lead to 400+ distinct scenarios. Obey Boss Tiger to eliminate a &quot;traitor&quot; (a police informant) for trust, or sneakily protect them? Report partial evidence, or risk deeper infiltration to expose his hidden backers? A careless word gains allies; a hesitant look sparks suspicion\u2014even from the shadow force\u2014spelling doom. Your choices between conscience and duty write your legend, mirroring the tough decisions real anti-narcotics police make daily.\u200b</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3785560/extras/d8e673b2faea52b37b84b7366cc2828d.poster.avif?t=1755742101\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3785560/extras/d8e673b2faea52b37b84b7366cc2828d.webm?t=1755742101\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3785560/extras/d8e673b2faea52b37b84b7366cc2828d.mp4?t=1755742101\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Characters &amp; Endings\u200b</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You'll encounter 10+ characters shaping the outcome. They\u2019re Boss Tiger loyalists, gray-area businessmen, or fellow undercover agents. Your choices make them allies or enemies, triggering chain reactions that alter the ending: take down Boss Tiger and his backers, perish in the storm, or carve an unexpected path\u2014all hinge on your interactions. Each ending is a reminder of the sacrifices made by those who stand as walls against the criminals.\u200b</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3785560/extras/7f0da9b98b5e36c72ec654fb8d498997.poster.avif?t=1755742101\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3785560/extras/7f0da9b98b5e36c72ec654fb8d498997.webm?t=1755742101\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3785560/extras/7f0da9b98b5e36c72ec654fb8d498997.mp4?t=1755742101\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Features\u200b</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Deep Immersion</strong>: Tied to the TV series, 1988 Wanbei\u2014neon streets, mahjong alleys, drug dens\u2014puts you in the tense undercover world, especially when tangling with the shadow force, letting you glimpse the harsh reality anti-narcotics police face.\u200b</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Branching Plots</strong>: Every decision ripples outward, unlocking relationships, secrets, and endings. Capture Brother Hu and his backers, die, or fall to temptation\u2014you control it all, experiencing the weight of responsibility borne by real heroes.\u200b</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Authentic Settings</strong>: Nostalgic video halls, busy markets, guarded labs, opulent clubs recreate 1988 Wanbei, with dangers and opportunities in every corner, reflecting the environments where anti-narcotics police carry out their missions.\u200b</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Character Growth</strong>: From flustered novice to calm negotiator, A Gu\u2019s growth\u2014vital when facing the shadow force\u2014depends on your choices, paralleling the development of real anti-narcotics officers as they hone their skills in the line of duty.\u200b</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As Wanbei\u2019s night falls, what secrets lurk? What hides behind Boss Tiger\u2019s smile and his backers\u2019 masks? Don the &quot;A Gu&quot; disguise, step into &quot;Dark Eyes&quot;, and write your justice story. Through this journey, may we always remember: there are those who take on the darkness so that we may live in light\u2014they are the walls that guard our nation's peace. Coming soon to Steam.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p>",
