shadowy backers. Success nears, but its cost could be staggering, just as the real anti-narcotics heroes risk everything to uphold justice.\u200b</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3785560/extras/337bb29cfecdf9c00abe6a2ef0efd231.poster.avif?t=1755742101\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3785560/extras/337bb29cfecdf9c00abe6a2ef0efd231.webm?t=1755742101\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3785560/extras/337bb29cfecdf9c00abe6a2ef0efd231.mp4?t=1755742101\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Rich Choices &amp; Plots\u200b</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over 100 choices lead to 400+ distinct scenarios. Obey Boss Tiger to eliminate a &quot;traitor&quot; (a police informant) for trust, or sneakily protect them? Report partial evidence, or risk deeper infiltration to expose his hidden backers? A careless word gains allies; a hesitant look sparks suspicion\u2014even from the shadow force\u2014spelling doom. Your choices between conscience and duty write your legend, mirroring the tough decisions real anti-narcotics police make daily.\u200b</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3785560/extras/d8e673b2faea52b37b84b7366cc2828d.poster.avif?t=1755742101\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3785560/extras/d8e673b2faea52b37b84b7366cc2828d.webm?t=1755742101\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3785560/extras/d8e673b2faea52b37b84b7366cc2828d.mp4?t=1755742101\" type=\"vid